     "op": "theory",
     "blockId": "p3-reference-block",
     "replacement": "**On reference sheet**\t**Not on reference sheet**\n**Reciprocal trigonometric ratios** $$\\begin{gathered}\\sec A=\\frac{1}{\\cos A},\\quad\\cos A\\ne0\\\\[3pt]\\operatorname{cosec} A=\\frac{1}{\\sin A},\\quad\\sin A\\ne0\\\\[3pt]\\cot A=\\frac{\\cos A}{\\sin A},\\quad\\sin A\\ne0\\end{gathered}$$ **Pythagorean identity** $$\\cos^2x+\\sin^2x=1$$\t**Tangent and cotangent ratio** $$\\tan A=\\frac{\\sin A}{\\cos A},\\ \\cos A\\ne0\\qquad\\cot A=\\frac{1}{\\tan A},\\ \\sin A\\ne0,\\ \\cos A\\ne0$$ **Complementary angle identities** $$\\begin{array}{cc}\\sin(90^\\circ-\\theta)=\\cos\\theta&\\cos(90^\\circ-\\theta)=\\sin\\theta\\\\\\tan(90^\\circ-\\theta)=\\cot\\theta&\\cot(90^\\circ-\\theta)=\\tan\\theta\\\\\\sec(90^\\circ-\\theta)=\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta&\\operatorname{cosec}(90^\\circ-\\theta)=\\sec\\theta\\end{array}$$ **Symmetry** $$\\begin{array}{ccc}\\sin(-x)&\\tan(-x)&\\cos(-x)\\\\=-\\sin x&=-\\tan x&=\\cos x\\end{array}$$ **Pythagorean identity** $$\\begin{gathered}1+\\tan^2x=\\sec^2x\\\\\\cot^2x+1=\\operatorname{cosec}^2x\\end{gathered}$$\n**Compound angle identities** $$\\begin{aligned}\\sin(A+B)&=\\sin A\\cos B+\\cos A\\sin B\\\\\\cos(A+B)&=\\cos A\\cos B-\\sin A\\sin B\\\\\\tan(A+B)&=\\frac{\\tan A+\\tan B}{1-\\tan A\\tan B}\\end{aligned}$$\t**Compound angle identities** $$\\begin{aligned}\\sin(A-B)&=\\sin A\\cos B-\\cos A\\sin B\\\\\\cos(A-B)&=\\cos A\\cos B+\\sin A\\sin B\\\\\\tan(A-B)&=\\frac{\\tan A-\\tan B}{1+\\tan A\\tan B}\\end{aligned}$$ **Double angle identities** $$\\sin(2A)=2\\sin A\\cos A$$ $$\\begin{aligned}\\cos(2A)&=\\cos^2A-\\sin^2A\\\\&=2\\cos^2A-1\\\\&=1-2\\sin^2A\\end{aligned}$$ $$\\tan(2A)=\\frac{2\\tan A}{1-\\tan^2A}$$",
     "autoApply": true,
